# Paths to sync when contributing tooling back to the upstream skeleton.
# Format: source_relative_to_repo_root|destination_relative_to_upstream_.skeleton/
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Blank lines ignored.
# Only list process/tooling files; never add product-only paths.

